t to help them streamline and automate their provisioning efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q3-2019-e.aspx"},{"c":"SAIL 2019 Q3","e":"sail","d":"2019-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark D. McClain","x":"They needed a solution that would free up their resource-constrained IT team to prioritize on areas of greatest business risk while streamlining and simplifying important but time-intensive identity governance processes like onboarding and offboarding or regular certification of user access.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q3-2019-e.aspx"},{"c":"SAIL 2019 Q3","e":"sail","d":"2019-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Ream","x":"We are increasing our outlook for total revenue for the year to be in the range of $284 million to $285.5 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q3-2019-e.aspx"},{"c":"SAIL 2019 Q3","e":"sail","d":"2019-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Ream","x":"The primary drivers of the increased outlook our subscription revenue, which we now expect to be approximately 140 $1 million for the year, up from our previous guidance of 137 to 130 $8 million and license revenue where we are increasing our expectations to 102 to one Hundred and $3 million and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q3-2019-e.aspx"},{"c":"SAIL 2019 Q4","e":"sail","d":"2020-02-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark McClain","x":"For example, one of our customers, a large retail propane distributor recently extended their investment in SailPoint fully recognizing the value of AI to their existing IdentityNow SaaS-based identity program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q4-2019-e.aspx"},{"c":"SAIL 2019 Q4","e":"sail","d":"2020-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McClain","x":"…and focus, part of what we're delivering with Predictive Identity is helping them automate and streamline a lot of the relatively repetitive road parts of identity governance of which there is a lot, so that they can focus on the real risk in security concerns that the organization has. And as","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q4-2019-e.aspx"},{"c":"SAIL 2020 Q1","e":"sail","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Ream","x":"From an expense perspective, like everyone else, we have and will continue to realize some natural cost savings from lower travel expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q1-2020-e.aspx"},{"c":"SAIL 2020 Q3","e":"sail","d":"2020-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark McClain","x":"SailPoint brings a rich history of innovation in identity, which is evidenced most notably by the continued investments we make to embed AI and ML technologies into the core of our identity platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q3-2020-e/"},{"c":"SAIL 2021 Q1","e":"sail","d":"2021-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McClain","x":"SailPoint delivered across the board as their trusted identity partner providing them with an identity security platform that will help reduce risk, improve and streamline compliance efforts and support their transformation to the cloud.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/11/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q1-2021-e/"},{"c":"SAIL 2021 Q1","e":"sail","d":"2021-05-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Ream","x":"As a result, we are raising our full-year outlook for total ARR to $340 million to $345 million, up from $333 million to $339 million previously.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/11/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q1-2021-e/"},{"c":"SAIL 2021 Q1","e":"sail","d":"2021-05-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Ream","x":"As such, we are also raising our full-year outlook for SaaS revenue by $5 million to $6 million to a range of $102 million to $105 million or 52% to 57% growth year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/11/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q1-2021-e/"},{"c":"SAIL 2021 Q2","e":"sail","d":"2021-08-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark McClain","x":"Certainly, we made a lot of investment as we've said for a little while now around AI and some things and then we've obviously brought in a couple of -- acquired pieces of technology.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/09/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q2-2021-e/"},{"c":"SAIL 2021 Q2","e":"sail","d":"2021-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McClain","x":"For example, in Q2, a long time SailPoint customer in the property and casualty insurance space added our AI enabled SaaS services to help them further streamline and modernize their approach to identity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/09/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q2-2021-e/"},{"c":"SAIL 2021 Q2","e":"sail","d":"2021-08-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Ream","x":"Of course, our profitability outperformance in Q2 raises our outlook for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/09/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q2-2021-e/"},{"c":"SAIL 2021 Q2","e":"sail","d":"2021-08-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark McClain","x":"So, yeah, all those things together, I think we will see, we believe, potentially a little stronger uplift in that kind of movement in '22 as with last half of this year and as we move into '22 but I wouldn't tell you that we would tag some increased outlook to it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/09/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q2-2021-e/"},{"c":"SAIL 2021 Q3","e":"sail","d":"2021-11-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Cam McMartin","x":"We believe this highlights the fantastic economics inherent in our perpetual maintenance business, which continues to benefit from annual price increases and a gross renewal rate well above 95%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q3-2021-e/"},{"c":"SAIL 2021 Q3","e":"sail","d":"2021-11-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark McClain","x":"During the quarter, we announced our new workflows capability, which is designed to help customers streamline and automate repetitive manual security tasks with minimal to no coding required.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q3-2021-e/"},{"c":"SAIL 2021 Q3","e":"sail","d":"2021-11-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Cam McMartin","x":"Based upon our outperformance in Q3, a healthy Q4 pipeline and a faster-than-expected shift to subscription and specifically SaaS, we're raising our full year outlook for total ARR to $358 million to $360 million, up from $343 million to $347 million previously.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q3-2021-e/"},{"c":"SAIL 2021 Q3","e":"sail","d":"2021-11-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Cam McMartin","x":"In addition to raising our guidance for total ARR, we are also raising our full year outlook for SaaS revenue by $5.5 million to $7.5 million to a range of $110.5 million to $111.5 million or 65% to 67% growth year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/sailpoint-technologies-holdings-inc-sail-q3-2021-e/"},{"c":"SAIL 2026 Q3","e":"sail","d":"2025-12-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark D. McClain","x":"And our partner ecosystem is leveraging AI to streamline and accelerate application onboarding, expediting time to value for our joint customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/sailpoint-sail-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAIL 2026 Q3","e":"sail","d":"2025-12-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brian Carolan","x":"Our strong quarterly results, underscored by our increased guidance, reflect the inherent strength of our market position and continued product innovation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/sailpoint-sail-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAIL 2027 Q2","e":"sail","d":"2026-09-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark McClain","x":"This new customer is leveraging our core Identity security cloud with advanced digital identity governance across thousands of machine identities while establishing a direct path to upgrade to our Agentic Business Suite as they scale their AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/sailpoint-sail-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SAIL 2027 Q2","e":"sail","d":"2026-09-09","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Brian Carolan","x":"This is particularly evident within our installed base, where customers adopting our AI-driven solutions increased their annual spend by over 60%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/sailpoint-sail-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,10560,0,0,0,8532,1522],[37,1,10147,0,0,0,8526,1210],[38,1,6820,0,0,0,5662,796],[39,1,5143,0,0,0,4119,711],[40,1,5492,0,0,0,4769,420],[41,1,6676,0,0,0,6192,156],[42,1,7990,0,0,0,7022,582],[43,1,7617,0,0,0,6359,925],[44,1,6598,0,0,0,5437,718],[45,1,8174,0,0,0,6463,1285],[46,1,8006,0,0,0,6722,887],[47,1,9677,0,0,0,8026,1207],[63,1,9351,0,0,0,7485,1252],[64,1,8944,0,0,0,7309,1277],[65,1,9278,0,0,0,75